{
  "id": "aa0de61f-077f-48b4-b946-5d2fbf60f363",
  "page_title": "'Quickstart: Use Azure OpenAI Assistants (Preview) via the Azure OpenAI Studio'",
  "page_description": "Walkthrough on how to get started with Azure OpenAI and make your first completions call with Azure OpenAI Studio.",
  "page_date": "05/31/2024",
  "chunk_title": "Go to the Azure OpenAI Studio",
  "chunk_content": "Go to the Azure OpenAI Studio  Navigate to Azure OpenAI Studio at <a href=\"https://oai.azure.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://oai.azure.com/</a> and sign-in with credentials that have access to your Azure OpenAI resource. During or after the sign-in workflow, select the appropriate directory, Azure subscription, and Azure OpenAI resource.  From the Azure OpenAI Studio landing page launch the Assistant's playground from the left-hand navigation Playground > Assistants (Preview)  :::image type=\"content\" source=\"../media/quickstarts/assistants-studio.png\" alt-text=\"Screenshot of the Azure OpenAI Studio landing page.\" lightbox=\"../media/quickstarts/assistants-studio.png\":::",
